{%- comment -%}
============================================================================
  MAHARAJONG — Founding Edition landing page (Shopify Liquid)
============================================================================

  WHERE TO PASTE THIS:
  --------------------
  Option A (recommended — dedicated page template):
    1. Admin → Online Store → Themes → ⋯ → Edit code.
    2. Under "Templates", click "Add a new template" →
       type: page → template type: Liquid → name it "maharajong-landing".
       (Creates templates/page.maharajong-landing.liquid)
    3. Delete the placeholder content and paste this ENTIRE file in.
    4. Admin → Online Store → Pages → Add page. Title: "Maharajong".
       In the "Theme template" dropdown (right sidebar) choose
       "page.maharajong-landing". Save.
    5. See DEPLOY.md to set this page as the homepage.

  Option B (Custom Liquid section, no new template):
    1. Admin → Online Store → Themes → Customize.
    2. On the Home page (or any page), Add section → "Custom Liquid".
    3. Paste this entire file into the Custom Liquid box. Save.
    (Note: theme header/footer will still render around it.)

  ASSETS TO UPLOAD (Edit code → Assets → Add a new asset):
  --------------------------------------------------------
  Upload these 4 marketing images, renamed EXACTLY as below so the
  {{ '...' | asset_url }} references resolve:
      hero-banner.png            (from design/marketing/hero/hero-banner.png)
      tile-showcase-strip.png    (from design/marketing/hero/tile-showcase-strip.png)
      og-image.png               (from design/marketing/hero/og-image.png)  — used via SEO, see DEPLOY.md
  Featured tile close-ups (from design/tiles/print-ready/...), renamed flat:
      tile-garuda.png            (honors/deity-garuda.png)
      tile-diwali.png            (bonus-festival/festival-diwali.png)
      tile-peacock-5.png         (suit-peacock/peacock-5.png)
      tile-anahata.png           (bonus-chakra/chakra-anahata.png)

  EMAIL CAPTURE:
  --------------
  Uses Shopify's native {% form 'customer' %}. Submissions create/update a
  customer tagged "preorder" (visible in Admin → Customers, filter by tag).
  No app required. See DEPLOY.md to verify.
============================================================================
{%- endcomment -%}

<style>
/* The .mrj full-bleed breakout uses 100vw, which includes the scrollbar
   width — clip the few px of horizontal overflow that would otherwise
   produce a horizontal scrollbar. */
body { overflow-x: clip; }
/* Hide the theme's auto-generated page title above the hero (our hero has
   its own H1) and collapse the emptied wrapper's spacing. The second rule
   is a fallback pinned to the specific Horizon text block. */
.shopify-section:has(.mrj) h1:not(.mrj h1) { display: none !important; }
.text-block--AYVNtOFBOS0JPekIrd__heading { display: none !important; }
.shopify-section:has(.mrj) .section-content-wrapper { padding-top: 0 !important; padding-bottom: 0 !important; }
.mrj {
  --navy: #0e1a3a; --navy-deep: #0a1330; --indigo: #1a2a5c;
  --gold: #c8a24a; --gold-bright: #e0c074; --ivory: #f6f0e2; --ivory-soft: #efe7d4;
  --muted: #b9c0d8;
  --serif-display: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
  --serif-body: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif;
  --sans: 'Jost', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
  color: var(--ivory); font-family: var(--sans); line-height: 1.6;
  background: var(--navy-deep);
  /* Full-bleed breakout: escape the theme's fixed-width page container so
     backgrounds span the whole viewport on large screens. Inner content is
     still centered and capped by .wrap (max-width 1160px). */
  margin-left: calc(50% - 50vw);
  margin-right: calc(50% - 50vw);
}
.mrj * { box-sizing: border-box; }
.mrj a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
.mrj .wrap { width: 100%; max-width: 1160px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 28px; }
.mrj h1, .mrj h2, .mrj h3 { font-family: var(--serif-display); font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.15; margin: 0; }
.mrj .eyebrow { font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.28em; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--gold-bright); }
.mrj .rangoli-rule { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:14px; margin:0 auto; color: var(--gold); }
.mrj .rangoli-rule .dot { font-size: 1rem; letter-spacing: 6px; }
.mrj .btn { display:inline-block; font-family: var(--sans); font-weight:500; letter-spacing:0.06em; font-size:0.82rem; text-transform:uppercase; padding:12px 26px; border-radius:2px; cursor:pointer; border:none; }
.mrj .btn-gold { background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--gold-bright), var(--gold)); color: var(--navy-deep); border:1px solid var(--gold-bright); box-shadow:0 6px 22px rgba(200,162,74,0.28); }
.mrj .btn-gold:hover { box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(200,162,74,0.42); }

/* HERO */
.mrj-hero { position:relative; min-height:600px; display:flex; align-items:center;
  background:
    linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(10,19,48,0.94) 0%, rgba(10,19,48,0.78) 42%, rgba(10,19,48,0.30) 100%),
    url('{{ "hero-banner.png" | asset_url }}') center right / cover no-repeat,
    var(--navy);
}
.mrj-hero .wrap { position:relative; z-index:2; padding-top:64px; padding-bottom:64px; }
.mrj-hero-content { max-width:620px; }
.mrj-hero h1 { font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 6vw, 4.4rem); margin:18px 0 6px; }
.mrj-hero h1 .accent { color: var(--gold-bright); }
.mrj-hero .subhead { font-family: var(--serif-body); font-size: clamp(1.25rem,2.4vw,1.7rem); color: var(--ivory-soft); font-weight:400; margin:16px 0 30px; max-width:520px; }
.mrj-form { display:flex; gap:10px; flex-wrap:wrap; max-width:480px; }
.mrj-form input[type="email"] { flex:1 1 220px; padding:13px 16px; border-radius:2px; border:1px solid rgba(200,162,74,0.5); background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06); color: var(--ivory); font-family: var(--sans); font-size:0.95rem; }
.mrj-form input[type="email"]::placeholder { color:#9aa2bd; }
.mrj-form input[type="email"]:focus { outline:none; border-color: var(--gold-bright); background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); }
.mrj-note { margin-top:14px; font-size:0.8rem; color: var(--muted); }
.mrj-success { margin-top:16px; padding:12px 16px; border:1px solid rgba(200,162,74,0.5); border-radius:3px; background: rgba(200,162,74,0.1); color: var(--gold-bright); font-family: var(--serif-body); font-size:1.1rem; }

/* SECTIONS */
.mrj section.block { padding: 88px 0; }
.mrj .section-head { text-align:center; max-width:720px; margin:0 auto 52px; }
.mrj .section-head h2 { font-size: clamp(2rem,4vw,2.9rem); margin:16px 0 18px; }
.mrj .section-head p { font-family: var(--serif-body); font-size:1.28rem; color: var(--ivory-soft); }

.mrj .story { background: var(--navy); }
.mrj .traditions { display:grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4,1fr); gap:22px; }
.mrj .tradition { background: linear-gradient(160deg, rgba(26,42,92,0.55), rgba(14,26,58,0.55)); border:1px solid rgba(200,162,74,0.2); border-radius:4px; padding:28px 22px; text-align:center; }
.mrj .tradition .num { font-family: var(--serif-display); color: var(--gold-bright); font-size:1.5rem; margin-bottom:8px; }
.mrj .tradition h3 { font-size:1.15rem; margin-bottom:8px; }
.mrj .tradition p { font-size:0.9rem; color: var(--muted); font-family: var(--sans); }

.mrj .showcase { background: var(--navy-deep); }
.mrj .strip { width:100%; border-radius:4px; overflow:hidden; margin:0 auto 52px; max-width:1160px; border:1px solid rgba(200,162,74,0.22); box-shadow:0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.4); }
.mrj .strip img { display:block; width:100%; height:auto; }
.mrj .tile-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4,1fr); gap:26px; }
.mrj .tile-card { text-align:center; }
.mrj .tile-frame { aspect-ratio:23/32; border-radius:8px; overflow:hidden; background: linear-gradient(160deg,#16224a,#0d1734); border:1px solid rgba(200,162,74,0.35); box-shadow:0 14px 34px rgba(0,0,0,0.45); padding:10px; transition: transform .25s; }
.mrj .tile-card:hover .tile-frame { transform: translateY(-6px); }
.mrj .tile-frame img { width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:contain; border-radius:4px; }
.mrj .tile-card .cap-name { font-family: var(--serif-display); font-size:1.05rem; color: var(--gold-bright); margin:16px 0 4px; }
.mrj .tile-card .cap-desc { font-size:0.82rem; color: var(--muted); }

.mrj .box { background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--navy), var(--indigo)); }
.mrj .box-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3,1fr); gap:20px; }
.mrj .box-item { display:flex; gap:16px; align-items:flex-start; padding:24px; border-radius:4px; background: rgba(10,19,48,0.5); border:1px solid rgba(200,162,74,0.18); }
.mrj .box-item .mark { font-family: var(--serif-display); color: var(--gold-bright); font-size:1.6rem; line-height:1; flex-shrink:0; width:34px; text-align:center; }
.mrj .box-item h3 { font-size:1.05rem; margin-bottom:5px; }
.mrj .box-item p { font-size:0.88rem; color: var(--muted); font-family: var(--sans); }
.mrj .box-item .prov { display:inline-block; margin-top:6px; font-size:0.72rem; color: var(--gold); font-style:italic; }
.mrj .box-disclaimer { margin-top:34px; text-align:center; font-size:0.85rem; color: var(--muted); font-style:italic; }

.mrj .play { background: var(--navy-deep); }
.mrj .steps { display:grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4,1fr); gap:24px; }
.mrj .step .step-num { font-family: var(--serif-display); font-weight:800; font-size:2.6rem; color: rgba(200,162,74,0.85); line-height:1; margin-bottom:14px; }
.mrj .step h3 { font-size:1.15rem; margin-bottom:8px; }
.mrj .step p { font-size:0.9rem; color: var(--muted); font-family: var(--sans); }
.mrj .step .term { color: var(--gold-bright); font-weight:500; }

.mrj .signup { background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 0%, rgba(200,162,74,0.14), transparent 55%), var(--navy); text-align:center; }
.mrj .signup-card { max-width:640px; margin:0 auto; }
.mrj .signup h2 { font-size: clamp(2rem,4vw,3rem); margin:18px 0 14px; }
.mrj .signup p.lead { font-family: var(--serif-body); font-size:1.3rem; color: var(--ivory-soft); margin-bottom:32px; }
.mrj .signup-form { display:flex; gap:10px; flex-wrap:wrap; justify-content:center; max-width:500px; margin:0 auto; }
.mrj .signup-form input[type="email"] { flex:1 1 240px; padding:14px 18px; border-radius:2px; border:1px solid rgba(200,162,74,0.5); background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06); color: var(--ivory); font-family: var(--sans); font-size:0.98rem; }
.mrj .signup-form input[type="email"]:focus { outline:none; border-color: var(--gold-bright); background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); }
.mrj .signup-note { margin-top:16px; font-size:0.8rem; color: var(--muted); }

.mrj .faq { background: var(--navy-deep); }
.mrj .faq-list { max-width:780px; margin:0 auto; }
.mrj .faq-item { border-bottom:1px solid rgba(200,162,74,0.2); }
.mrj .faq-item summary { list-style:none; cursor:pointer; padding:24px 40px 24px 0; position:relative; font-family: var(--serif-display); font-weight:600; font-size:1.25rem; color: var(--ivory); }
.mrj .faq-item summary::-webkit-details-marker { display:none; }
.mrj .faq-item summary::after { content:"+"; position:absolute; right:4px; top:50%; transform:translateY(-50%); color: var(--gold-bright); font-size:1.6rem; font-weight:300; }
.mrj .faq-item[open] summary::after { content:"\2013"; }
.mrj .faq-a { color: var(--muted); font-family: var(--sans); font-size:0.95rem; padding:0 0 24px; }

.mrj footer.mrj-footer { background: var(--navy-deep); border-top:1px solid rgba(200,162,74,0.22); padding:54px 0 40px; }
.mrj .footer-inner { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:flex-start; gap:30px; flex-wrap:wrap; }
.mrj .footer-brand .logo { font-family: var(--serif-display); font-weight:800; font-size:1.5rem; margin-bottom:10px; }
.mrj .footer-brand .logo span { color: var(--gold-bright); }
.mrj .footer-brand p { max-width:340px; color: var(--muted); font-size:0.88rem; }
.mrj .footer-bottom { margin-top:40px; padding-top:22px; border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06); display:flex; justify-content:space-between; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:10px; font-size:0.78rem; color:#7c85a6; }

@media (max-width:860px){ .mrj .traditions, .mrj .tile-grid, .mrj .steps { grid-template-columns: repeat(2,1fr); } .mrj .box-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr; } }
@media (max-width:460px){ .mrj .traditions, .mrj .steps { grid-template-columns:1fr; } }
</style>

<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
